{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411117-scion-2e-injury-conditions","id":1411117,"title":"Scion 2E Injury Conditions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-30T14:06:31-07:00","id":1411117,"title":"Scion 2E Injury Conditions","content":"Does anyone have an expanded list of injury conditions? The list in Origin is sorely lacking and before I really delve into creating an extensive list of my own I was hoping to get some help from you guys.<br /> For good or ill my group and I are a bunch of by the book guys so we like to have as much (a+b=c) rules and, as past experience has proved, shooting from the hip doesn't go over well for stuff like this.<br /> Any help would be much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24818-viper285","name":"Viper285","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T15:01:06-07:00","id":1411124,"title":"","content":"I mostly just make my injury conditions up on the spot, so like a -1 Injury is &quot;Dramatic Head Cut&quot; that would impose a penalty on things related to sight or something. I find the on-the-fly creation to be more suited to my playstyle. I mostly just need three things for an Injury.<br /> <br /> 1. Severity - How big the wound is will be major. 'Seeing spots' from a flashbang would be -1, while 'My organs are on the outside' would probably be a -4.<br /> 2. Area of Injury - Generally you want to know <i>where</i> or <i>what</i> the injury is effecting.<br /> 3. Effect - Maybe one or two action types that the injury effects. And try to aim more towards &quot;Action Movie&quot; or &quot;Story Told Around A Campfire&quot; for what an injury effects rather than realistic. Yes, realistically, a broken rib should probably hit you with a debilitating amount of pain each time you move, but for the sake of Scion it can be more limited.<br /> <br /> I know there's someone on the Nexus who made a Scion Re:Conditioned thing with a big list of Example Conditions. I don't know if Injuries are in there, but you can give it a look.<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh I dunno where it's clarified, might have been a Q&amp;A, but I believe that design intention is that if you have multiple injuries that would penalize the same roll, only use the highest one rather than all of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T16:35:36-07:00","id":1411131,"title":"","content":"The following CC may be what you are looking for.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/312271/Reconditioned?cPath=8329_32938\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/4261/312271.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/312271/Reconditioned?cPath=8329_32938\" target=\"_blank\"> Reconditioned - Onyx Path Publishing | StoryPath Nexus | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/312271/Recond